{"ticker":"VICI","updated":"2026-11-14T01:31:40Z","profile":{"longName":"VICI Properties Inc.","shortName":"VICI Properties Inc.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.viciproperties.com","fullTimeEmployees":28,"marketCap":27538149376,"trailingPE":11.578703,"forwardPE":8.420876,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.6267567,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":29.61458,"targetHighPrice":35.0,"targetLowPrice":24.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.058,"earningsGrowth":-0.563,"grossMargins":0.99275,"operatingMargins":0.77351,"profitMargins":0.56459,"totalRevenue":4155599872,"beta":0.654,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":30.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":22.425,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":7.42},"summary":"VICI Properties Inc. is a real estate investment trust that owns one of the largest portfolios of market-leading gaming, hospitality, wellness, entertainment and leisure destinations, including Caesars Palace Las Vegas, MGM Grand and the Venetian Resort Las Vegas. VICI Properties owns 103 experiential assets across a geographically diverse portfolio consisting of 63 gaming properties and 40 other experiential properties across the United States and Canada. The portfolio is comprised of approximately 130 million square feet and features approximately 66,000 hotel rooms and over 700 restaurants, bars, nightclubs and sports books. Its properties are occupied by industry-leading gaming, leisure and hospitality operators under long-term, triple-net lease agreements. VICI Properties has a growing array of real estate and financing partnerships with leading operators in other experiential sectors, including Cabot, Cain, Canyon Ranch, Chelsea Piers, Club Med, Great Wolf Resorts, Homefield, Kalahari Resorts and Lucky Strike Entertainment. VICI Properties also owns four championship golf courses and approximately 33 acres of undeveloped and underdeveloped land adjacent to the Las Vegas Strip. VICI Properties Inc. was established on July 05, 2016, and is based in New York, United States. VICI Properties Inc. was incorporated in Maryland.","summary_zh":"VICI Properties Inc. 是一家房地產投資信託公司，擁有市場領先的博彩、酒店、健康、娛樂和休閒目的地的最大投資組合之一，包括拉斯維加斯凱撒宮酒店、米高梅大酒店和拉斯維加斯威尼斯人度假村。 VICI Properties 在不同地域的投資組合中擁有 103 項體驗式資產，其中包括美國和加拿大的 63 項遊戲資產和 40 項其他體驗式資產。該投資組合佔地約 1.3 億平方英尺，擁有約 66,000 間酒店客房以及 700 多家餐廳、酒吧、夜總會和體育書籍。其物業由行業領先的博彩、休閒和酒店經營者根據長期、三網租賃協議佔用。 VICI Properties 與其他體驗領域的領先營運商建立了越來越多的房地產和融資合作夥伴關係，包括 Cabot、Cain、Canyon Ranch、Chelsea Piers、Club Med、Great Wolf Resorts、Homefield、Kalahari Resorts 和 Lucky Strike Entertainment。 VICI Properties 還擁有四個錦標賽高爾夫球場以及毗鄰拉斯維加斯大道的約 33 英畝未開發和未開發土地。 VICI Properties Inc.成立於2016年7月5日，總部位於美國紐約。 VICI Properties Inc. 在馬裡蘭州註冊成立。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":33.15,"h":33.24,"l":33.015,"c":33.08,"v":6068200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":33.09,"h":33.165,"l":32.615,"c":32.64,"v":7867000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":32.7,"h":33.09,"l":32.525,"c":32.6,"v":11692300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":32.15,"h":32.25,"l":31.98,"c":32.12,"v":6776900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":32.12,"h":32.15,"l":31.79,"c":31.84,"v":19309100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":31.92,"h":31.92,"l":31.41,"c":31.43,"v":9556000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":31.43,"h":31.93,"l":31.43,"c":31.93,"v":10957700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":31.87,"h":32.04,"l":31.65,"c":31.89,"v":12409000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":31.935,"h":32.185,"l":31.895,"c":32.04,"v":9043200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":32.18,"h":32.59,"l":32.125,"c":32.47,"v":7786000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":32.5,"h":32.7,"l":32.34,"c":32.56,"v":10006700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":32.52,"h":32.665,"l":32.21,"c":32.61,"v":13903600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":32.73,"h":33.0,"l":32.59,"c":32.91,"v":6902200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":32.83,"h":33.0,"l":32.485,"c":32.75,"v":5321500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":32.74,"h":33.005,"l":32.63,"c":32.63,"v":4206300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":32.52,"h":32.583,"l":32.17,"c":32.24,"v":6579100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o